  "content": "![](https://i.imgur.com/3onlleF.png)\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>整裝待發。升級進階。強大無匹。</b></font>\n  <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uDdtEDJ.png\" />\n    <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-Forge%20%7C%20NeoForge%20%7C%20Fabric-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.18.2%20%7C%201.19.2%20%7C%201.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury%20API-必要-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/伺服器端-必要-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/用戶端-必要-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>提升所有戰鬥裝備的等級</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">透過擊殺怪物與頭目來累積經驗！</font>\n    <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k3clITQ.png\" width=\"75%\"/>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"right\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>即使破損也能修復</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">使用鐵砧與對應材料即可修復！</font>\n    <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FHFsOqk.png\" width=\"75%\"/>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>全新遠程傷害屬性</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">適用於弓、十字弓與三叉戟等武器</font>\n    <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bmrz9zC.png\" width=\"75%\"/>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>隨心所欲調整模組設定</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">透過資料包、配置檔案，甚至 LevelingAPI 來自由調整！</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ojohhHB.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">官方文件請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/weaponleveling/wiki\">此處</a> </font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>你也可以在<a href=\"https://gekidolukas.github.io/levelable_item.html\">此處</a>生成可升級物品檔案</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>擴充模組</b></font>\n    <br>\n     <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wl-bc-compat\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qLE8biJ.png\" width=\"15%\"/>\n    </a>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>資訊</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>指令</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">使用 <b>/itemlevel &ltset|add&gt &ltplayer&gt &ltlevel|points&gt &ltamount&gt</b> 來改變武器等級</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>模組支援</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">雖然部分模組仍可能相容，但官方內建支援已改為以擴充模組為主，以便更快、更精準地更新這些模組與主模組。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>展示與評論</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"3\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/RJ7smpI5F7w?si=-yuSrtdNpSUYhknl&t=143\">Noxus 的焦點介紹 - 已過時</a></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>支援語言</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1f8.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"en_us\"> \n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e9-1f1ea.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"de_de\"> \n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e8-1f1f3.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"zh_cn by Kzeroko\"> \n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1f7-1f1fa.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"ru_ru by The_Same_Cat\"> \n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1e6.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"uk_ua by sosad\">\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
